{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1544683-lineage-spell-list","id":1544683,"title":"Lineage Spell List","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Curseborne"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-10-24T14:12:47-07:00","id":1544683,"title":"Lineage Spell List","content":"To help people who are playing with character builds, these are the lists of spells that have the Lineage tag keyed to whole Lineages (i.e. not including ones keyed to specific Families).<br /> <br /> Interestingly I thought that the Lineage (Family) tag was the same as the Secret Spell listing but it definitely isn't, the Sphinx, for example, have only one Secret Spell listed but loads of Lineage (Family) spells.<br /> <br /> This is just a list of spell names and which Lineage they belong to so that people have the full list of spells in front of them when creating characters (edit, strictly I don't think you can take these spells at character creation, but at 6XP each you can pick them up pretty early).<br /> <br /> <b>Dead</b><br /> Inhabit the Beast (Hungry)<br /> Embraced by Darkness (Hungry)<br /> Master of Beasts (Primals)<br /> Experience Mine (Sorcerers)<br /> Hallucination (Sorcerers)<br /> Flit (Sorcerers)<br /> Telekinesis (Sorcerers)<br /> <br /> <b>Hungry</b><br /> Aspect of the Beast (Primals)<br /> Bestial Voice (Primals)<br /> Master of Beasts (Primals)<br /> Scent of Danger (Primals)<br /> Archonic Voice (Outcasts)<br /> Many Faces (Outcasts)<br /> Life Absorption (Sorcerers)<br /> <br /> <b>Outcasts</b><br /> Dire Command (Hungry)<br /> Embraced by Darkness (Hungry)<br /> Silver Tongue (Primals)<br /> Instant Gratification (Sorcerers)<br /> Drain Quality (Sorcerers)<br /> Ring Silent Bells (Sorcerers)<br /> Elemental Armor (Sorcerers)<br /> Summon Imp (Sorcerers)<br /> <br /> <b>Primals</b><br /> Universal Keyhole (Dead)<br /> Bestial Familiar (Hungry)<br /> Dire Command (Hungry)<br /> Inhabit the Beast (Hungry)<br /